    { "id": "ar-07", "original": "روح بلّط البحر", "phonetic": "ruh ballat il-bahr (roo bal-LAT el-BAHR)", "translation": "get lost", "literal": "go tile the sea", "note": "Egyptian masterpiece: go do something impossible, far away from me.", "category": "playful", "severity": 1, "variants": ["ar-EG"] },
